
  lcm — lossless context management for coding agents

  Usage: lcm <command> [options]

  Setup
    install [--dry-run]    Register hooks, configure daemon, connect MCP
    uninstall [--dry-run]  Remove hooks and MCP registration

  Runtime
    daemon start|stop|restart  Manage the context daemon
    status [--json]            Daemon status and project memory stats
    doctor                     Diagnostics: daemon, hooks, MCP, summarizer
    mcp                        Start the MCP server (stdio transport)

  Memory
    search <query> [--limit N]                                                                   Search episodic and promoted memory
    grep <query> [--mode ...]                                                                    Search raw messages and summaries
    describe <nodeId>                                                                            Inspect metadata for a memory node
    expand <nodeId> [--depth N]                                                                  Expand a summary node into source detail
    store <text> [--tag ...]                                                                     Store a durable memory entry
    compact [--all] [--dry-run] [--replay] [--restart] [--no-promote]                            Compact conversations into DAG summaries (auto-promotes after)
    import [--provider claude|codex|all] [--all] [--verbose] [--dry-run] [--replay] [--restart]  Import Claude Code or Codex session transcripts
    promote [--all] [--verbose] [--dry-run]                                                      Promote insights to long-term memory
    stats [-v]                                                                                   Memory inventory and compression ratios
    diagnose [--all] [--days N] [--verbose] [--json]                                             Scan sessions for hook failures and issues

  Connectors
    connectors list [--format text|json]                List available agents and installed connectors
    connectors install <agent> [--type ...] [--global]  Install connector for a coding agent
    connectors remove <agent> [--type ...] [--global]   Remove connector for a coding agent
    connectors doctor [agent] [--global]                Check connector health

  Portable Knowledge
    export [--all] [--output <file>]  Export promoted knowledge to JSON (secrets scrubbed)
    import-knowledge <file>           Import exported knowledge JSON, deduplicating on merge

  Portable Knowledge
    export [--all] [--output <file>]  Export promoted knowledge to JSON (secrets scrubbed)
    import-knowledge <file>           Import exported knowledge JSON, deduplicating on merge

  Sensitive
    sensitive list                   List active redaction patterns
    sensitive add <pattern>          Add a redaction pattern
    sensitive remove <pattern>       Remove a redaction pattern
    sensitive test <text>            Test text against active patterns
    sensitive purge [--all] [--yes]  Purge all project data (stored memory and patterns)

  Hooks (internal)
    codex-hook   Native Codex lifecycle — capture, restore, recall, and compact
    restore      SessionStart hook — restore prior context
    session-end  Stop hook — finalize and store session memory
    user-prompt  UserPromptSubmit hook — record user prompt context
    post-tool    PostToolUse hook — record tool invocation events

  Flags
    -V, --version            Show version
    -h, --help               Show this help

  Run 'lcm <command> --help' for options and examples.

